ZCode image-search plugin
Copyright 2025 Z.ai

This package is an unofficial DeepSeek Harness port of the ZCode built-in
image-search plugin. The upstream MCP declaration is copied verbatim into
mcp.json and zcode-plugin.json; its copyright and license notice remain those
of the original author.

Upstream source: /Applications/ZCode.app/Contents/Resources/glm/packages/image-search-plugin
  .zcode-plugin/plugin.json   name=image-search, version=0.1.1, license=Apache-2.0
  .mcp.json                   streamable HTTP MCP endpoint
  README.md

The only changes are the ones required to run on DSH: the DSH MCP client takes
an explicit URL and headers instead of ZCode's `auth: { type: zcode_official,
provider: jwt_token }` scheme. ZCode resolves that scheme to two headers —
`Authorization` from the `zcodejwttoken` credential and
`X-Bigmodel-Authorization` from the coding-plan credential — and index.js
reproduces both from ZCODE_BASE_URL, ZCODE_JWT_TOKEN, and
ZCODE_CODING_PLAN_TOKEN. The endpoint origin defaults to the value copied from
ZCode, `https://zcode.z.ai`; no credential ships with this package.

